738 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Product Design Manager\050Apr 2023 \023 Present \174 Doha\054 Qatar \050Remote\051\nEstablished a centralized product design function across 4 business streams\054 building and leading a team of 6 designers and introducing scalable design management practices across digital products\056\nReduced design delivery cycles by 50\045 \050from 4 to 2 weeks\051 by implementing structured DesignOps workflows\054 Definition of Ready \050DoR\051\054 and cross\055functional delivery processes\056\nDeveloped a competency framework\054 career progression system\054 and hiring standards integrated into company\055wide performance reviews\054 enabling targeted professional development and internal promotions\056\nLed cross\055product design strategy\054 capacity planning\054 and resource allocation\054 aligning designers\047 individual objectives with product roadmaps and business priorities\056\nBuilt and scaled a unified Design System adopted by 4\053 cross\055functional teams\054 establishing reusable components\054 guidelines\054 and design governance\056\nEstablished a data\055driven design practice\054 training designers in product analytics\054 dashboards\054 and user session analysis\054 and embedding measurable KPIs into design workflows\056\nLed cross\055product UX strategy for QIC\047s transformation from standalone insurance service into a connected digital ecosystem\054 aligning product experiences with business strategy\056)
     /K [ 7 ]
     /P 739 0 R
     /Pg 724 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

