742 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Senior Product Designer\050Nov 2022 \023 Apr 2023 \174 Doha\054 Qatar \050Remote\051\nImproved registration conversion rate by 11\045 through a UX\055focused redesign \050of the onboarding flow\073\nLed transformation of a single\055purpose app into a scalable ecosystem platform\054 enabling the launch of 4\053 new sub\055products within one unified UX framework\073\nLaunched four distinct B2C service flows from the ground up\054 focused on mobile\055first experiences\054 resulting in a 14\045 rise in user engagement metrics on mobile devices\073\nPiloted initial UX research\054 completing 10 A\057B tests on multiply flows\054 findings directed design enhancements which improved user activation rates by 4\045\056)
     /K [ 9 ]
     /P 743 0 R
     /Pg 724 0 R
